"url":"https://akonno.github.io/FluidSeminarMaterials//build/terminal1.drawio-504550d9f4fbaa034c6c2439df448543.png","alt":"Miniforge Promptで，作成したプログラムを実行している例．白文字で表示されているのがユーザーが入力する文字列である．\n①EXERCISE環境に入り，②プログラムを置いているディレクトリまでcdコマンドを使って移動する．③dirコマンドでそのファイルがあるかどうかを確認し（③’），④そのプログラムをpythonコマンドに与えて実行して，結果を確認する（④’）．","data":{"altTextIsAutoGenerated":true},"key":"hum4jHDpCQ","urlSource":"./images/terminal1.drawio.png"},{"type":"caption","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":123,"column":1},"end":{"line":124,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"captionNumber","kind":"figure","label":"fig-pygame-terminal1","identifier":"fig-pygame-terminal1","html_id":"fig-pygame-terminal1","enumerator":"49","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Figure ","key":"MvPZTnW0P8"},{"type":"text","value":"49","key":"gNCYucFKlK"},{"type":"text","value":":","key":"nIrpUN8Jzk"}],"template":"Figure %s:","key":"twAw0rEQfX"},{"type":"text","value":"Miniforge Promptで，作成したプログラムを実行している例．白文字で表示されているのがユーザーが入力する文字列である．\n①EXERCISE環境に入り，②プログラムを置いているディレクトリまで","position":{"start":{"line":123,"column":1},"end":{"line":123,"column":1}},"key":"yq6Cpl5xjS"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cd","position":{"start":{"line":123,"column":1},"end":{"line":123,"column":1}},"key":"orzSmDYxmi"},{"type":"text","value":"コマンドを使って移動する．③","position":{"start":{"line":123,"column":1},"end":{"line":123,"column":1}},"key":"r0a31bvhi8"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"dir","position":{"start":{"line":123,"column":1},"end":{"line":123,"column":1}},"key":"m4kROjUQUA"},{"type":"text","value":"コマンドでそのファイルがあるかどうかを確認し（③’），④そのプログラムをpythonコマンドに与えて実行して，結果を確認する（④’）．","position":{"start":{"line":123,"column":1},"end":{"line":123,"column":1}},"key":"wVdg1oPwa8"}],"key":"I5BayMiIfx"}],"key":"kje48QjdM5"}],"label":"fig-pygame-terminal1","identifier":"fig-pygame-terminal1","enumerator":"49","html_id":"fig-pygame-terminal1","key":"QZbPlUdpqz"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":128,"column":1},"end":{"line":128,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"PyGame-CEによる最初のプログラム（ウィンドウを開く・図形を描く）","position":{"start":{"line":128,"column":1},"end":{"line":128,"column":1}},"key":"qglDEhyYjt"}],"identifier":"pygame-ce","label":"PyGame-CEによる最初のプログラム（ウィンドウを開く・図形を描く）","html_id":"pygame-ce-1","implicit":true,"key":"pktV4tuMT5"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":130,"column":1},"end":{"line":130,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"新しいPythonファイルを作り，そこに以下のプログラムを保存して，実行してみよう．","position":{"start":{"line":130,"column":1},"end":{"line":130,"column":1}},"key":"uAlV7YCmbq"}],"key":"UH3PzMaF30"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","value":"import pygame\n\n# 初期化\npygame.init()\n\n# 400ピクセル×400ピクセルのウィンドウをつくる\nWIDTH, HEIGHT = 400, 400\nscreen = pygame.display.set_mode((WIDTH, HEIGHT))\npygame.display.set_caption(\"PyGame-CE Program 1: basic drawing\")\n\nclock = pygame.time.Clock()\nrunning = True\n\n# メインループ\nwhile running:\n    # 1. イベント処理\n    for event in pygame.event.get():\n        if event.type == pygame.QUIT:\n            running = False  # ウィンドウ右上の×で終了\n\n    # 2. 背景を塗る\n    screen.fill((220, 220, 220))  # R,G,B [0-255]\n\n    # 3. 図形を描く\n    # 青い円 (x=200, y=200, 半径30)\n    pygame.draw.circle(screen, (0, 0, 255), (200, 200), 30)\n\n    # 赤い四角形 (x=50, y=50, 幅80, 高さ80)\n    pygame.draw.rect(screen, (255, 0, 0), (50, 50, 80, 80))\n\n    # 4. 画面を更新\n    pygame.display.flip()\n\n    # 5. フレームレート制御 (1秒あたり60フレーム程度)\n    clock.tick(60)\n\n# 終了処理\npygame.quit()","position":{"start":{"line":132,"column":1},"end":{"line":171,"column":1}},"key":"SlhQE3X7gK"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":173,"column":1},"end":{"line":174,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"下図のような画面が表示されることを確認せよ．\nプログラムの詳細は今後学ぶこととし，いまは説明しない．","position":{"start":{"line":173,"column":1},"end":{"line":173,"column":1}},"key":"a0ielV611l"}],"key":"ICX42p2TLL"},{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"https://akonno.github.io/FluidSeminarMaterials//build/pygam